<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44640" root="&#xA;                        وضن&#xA;                    " body-key="w1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَضِينٌ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>A girth</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِطَان</span>) <i>wide, woven of thongs
or hair,</i> or <i>only of skin;</i> (M, K;) <i>said to be
adapted for the</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَحْل</span>
                        <i>and the</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَوْدَج</span>; the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِطَان</span>
being peculiarly for the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَتَب</span>: (M:) or <i>it is for
the</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَوْدَج</span>, <i>like the</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِطَان</span>
                        <i>for the</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَتَب</span>
                        <i>and the</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَصْدِير</span>
                        <i>for the</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَحْل</span>
                        <i>and the</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِزَام</span>
                        <i>for the</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَرْج</span>;
and <i>both</i> [but to what this refers is doubtful]
<i>are like the</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نِسْع</span>, <i>except that they are of thongs
woven one upon another, doubly</i> or <i>more.</i> (S.)

  </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
